            (flohm-organ "form-cli-in-process-program-image-call" 0
                5 5 (flohp-stamp) "the resident admitted PIF now receives one externally correlated current-source capability as exact typed [held,current] native nodes; knowledge/current-source-bound returns 1 for identity, present 0 for drift, and timeout with zero outputs at the 7/6 fuel cliff; malformed kind trees and forged evidence are refused before evaluation; legacy receipt coordinates remain fixed; current answer bytes and lookup outcome still remain outside the resident receipt, so form-cli cannot yet retire its process membrane"
                (fmcl-attempt-category) "carry the bounded current answer and lookup outcome through the same source-bound typed resident receipt, then retain load/call/return/fault/timeout/release evidence at the form-cli door")
            (flohm-organ "public-source-retrieval-current-closure" 1
                5 5 (flohp-stamp) "fresh live census and shard report agree at the current moving denominator across all observed families; stale/missing/invalid/ambiguities 0; exact-route lookup fresh; model-executed 0"
